<title>USA: LIPA trustees to meet Tuesday.</title>
<headline>LIPA trustees to meet Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>GARDEN CITY, N.Y. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Long Island Power Authority said its Board of Trustees has scheduled its next meeting for Tuesday, May 13, at 1600 EDT/2000 GMT.</p>
<p>The meeting will be held in the lower level Teleconference Room of the OMNI in Uniondale, N.Y.</p>
<p>LIPA's proposal to acquire part of Long Island Lighting Co in a transaction including Brooklyn Union Gas Co is now pending before New York's Public Authorities Control Board.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
